SUMMARY:Observe the Moon Day - Day Event
DESCRIPTION:[vc_row][vc_column width=”1/1″][vc_column_text uncode_shortcode_id=”151877″]Mark your calendars for Saturday\, September 19\, to celebrate International Observe the Moon Day with the North Museum! Join us for a Moon-focused Night Sky Tour\, or try some of the Moon activities around the museum! \nActivities will include making your own lunar footprint\, building your own lunar lander\, finding the man in the Moon\, and more![/vc_column_text][/vc_column][/vc_row]
URL:https://northmuseum.org/events/observe-the-moon-day-day-event/
LOCATION:North Museum\, PA\, United States
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://northmuseum.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/moonday-cal-day.jpg
END:VEVENT
