SUMMARY:STEM Career Constellation Series: Manufacturing Day
DESCRIPTION:[vc_row][vc_column width=”1/1″][vc_column_text uncode_shortcode_id=”252785″] \nSTEM Career Constellation Series: Manufacturing Day\nNorth Museum – Saturday October 3\, 2026\n10:00 am- 3:00 pm\nDiscover the many ways STEM comes to life in today’s manufacturing industry! Students in grades 6–12 will meet STEM professionals\, explore educational and career pathways\, and participate in hands-on activities that bring manufacturing to life. From engineering and skilled trades to data science\, programming\, robotics\, and quality control\, students will discover the wide range of careers and skills that power modern manufacturing and learn how their interests and talents can connect to exciting opportunities in the field. \nMeet representatives from local manufacturers\, including Precision Cobotics\, Mantec\, Machined Products and others. \nCareer Exploration and Readiness \n\nMeet Manufacturing Industry professionals\nParticipate in hands-on activities like slime\, liquid nitrogen\, & assembly line simulation\nLearn about AI in manufacturing\nInteract with operational robots\nDiscover locally manufactured products\nExplore career opportunities in manufacturing\nFind out if manufacturing might be the career for you!\n\n[/vc_column_text][vc_button button_color=”color-395923″ size=”btn-xl” radius=”btn-circle” outline=”yes” border_width=”0″ link=”url:https%3A%2F%2F68796.blackbaudhosting.com%2F68796%2FManufacturing-Day” button_color_type=”uncode-palette” uncode_shortcode_id=”287753″]Register[/vc_button][/vc_column][/vc_row]
URL:https://northmuseum.org/events/stem-career-constellation-series-manufacturing-day/
LOCATION:North Museum\, PA\, United States
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://northmuseum.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/ccs-events-mnf.jpg
END:VEVENT
